1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,230
Li Yuanfeng !

25
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,870
Ceng Niu...

26
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:07,670
How did his cultivation recover entirely in just a few years !?

27
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,850
You’ve got guts

28
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,750
to invade Xue Yue’s Ice and Snow Palace !

29
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,160
You're courting death !

30
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:44,790
Scram !

31
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:54,400
The power of this single word

32
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,590
was no weaker than Soul Transformation !

33
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,150
My two bodies merged together

34
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,790
are mutually enhancing each other.

35
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,560
This mutation didn't happen before.

36
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,600
In just a few years,

37
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,190
you’ve actually reached Late stage Soul Formation...

38
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,190
Today...

39
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,510
I will refine your soul !

40
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,550
Ceng Niu,

41
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,150
don't drag others

42
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:53,790
into our fight.

43
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,070
Fine.

44
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,520
Then the both of us

45
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,870
will settle

46
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,310
what happened that day.

47
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:02,800
Everyone, retreat 10 000 li !

48
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,710
Yes !

49
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,840
Soul Extracting Drum

50
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:18,950
I’ll make sure you don't make it out alive today !

51
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:27,320
This drum can disturb the Origin Soul.

52
00:04:30,230 --> 00:04:31,590
Ceng Niu,

53
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:35,390
do you enjoy the taste of my Soul Extracting Drum ?

54
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,470
How can the drum fail ?!

55
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,680
Slash !

56
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,470
Is this the power of Soul Transformation ?

57
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:51,320
How could you have humiliated me like this

58
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,030
if not for my unhealed injuries !?

59
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:56,520
Even if my cultivation plummets today,

60
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,110
I will still kill you !

61
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,470
Tea Domain !

62
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,270
Soul Formation brat,

63
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:23,150
I will let you taste the strength of celestial spiritual energy !

64
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:31,150
Die !

65
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:44,080
The physical form of a Soul Transformation cultivator’s domain

66
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,360
is really strong !

67
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:15,950
Fall !

68
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:19,710
Ceng Niu,

69
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,600
I'll make sure

70
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:23,420
Xue Yue becomes your grave !

71
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:39,040
Soul Transformation spells are profound

72
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:41,360
but your celestial spiritual energy

73
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,070
is far too sparse.

74
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:47,600
I hoped this fight would help me grasp what Soul Transformation is

75
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,030
and you’ve indeed given me new insights.

76
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,310
Die !

77
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,360
If celestial spiritual energy can infuse a domain...

78
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:59,870
can Ancient God power do the same ?

79
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:21,520
What...

80
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,680
What domain is this ?!

81
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:25,130
Life and Death

82
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,880
Reincarnation !

83
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,190
His domain...

84
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,440
has already reached Soul Transformation ?!

85
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,950
So you are the one who sent that man back then...

86
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,950
Unseal !

87
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:15,160
You're unworthy

88
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:17,120
of these artifacts !

89
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,030
Go !

90
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,400
Seal !

91
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,800
Ceng Niu,

92
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,310
even if I die today,

93
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,270
I will drag you down with me !

94
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,190
Suzerain !

95
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:49,830
Suzerain !

96
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,110
Suzerain !

97
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,430
Exploding your Origin Soul ?

98
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,590
Try it.

99
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:01,830
I can tear open a spatial rift and leave anytime.

100
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:04,270
So the only ones who will die

101
00:10:05,690 --> 00:10:07,760
are the people of Xue Yue...

102
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:15,710
Alright,

103
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,990
this old man has lost.

104
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:21,350
But Xue Yue is innocent,

105
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,350
don’t slaughter them all.

106
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,270
If you agree,

107
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,790
this old man will be at your mercy !

108
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:30,390
I want your Soul Transformation soul.

109
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:46,030
Suzerain...

110
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:00,310
My cultivation

111
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,990
has fallen to Nascent Soul !

112
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,630
I won’t kill you.

113
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:06,910
But from now on,

114
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:10,000
no Soul Formation cultivators are allowed to exist in Xue Yue

115
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,230
and cultivation sects are forbidden.

116
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,440
If you disobey...

117
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,190
I will come back.

118
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:17,640
Seal !

119
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:25,160
Back then, Xue Yue climbed over the Four Sects Alliance’s corpses

120
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,830
to become a rank 5 country.

121
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:28,590
But now...

122
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:31,070
the tide has turned...

123
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:38,590
As expected, this old man has a keen eye for talent !

124
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:44,990
This kid actually killed a Soul Transformation cultivator

125
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:47,230
with a Late stage Soul Formation cultivation !

126
00:11:45,790 --> 00:11:48,630
Zhou Wutai\NMiddle stage Soul Formation

127
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,390
It's not an easy feat.

128
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,710
Brother Wang is truly extraordinary.

129
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:56,990
He turned Xue Yue to a rank 3 country

130
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:59,230
so you should help him too.

131
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:01,550
In that case,

132
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,510
you will go fight Liu Mei.

133
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:07,510
See how far her Thousand Illusions Ruthless Domain

134
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,590
has progressed.

135
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:12,840
Understood.

136
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:19,550
Zhuque Zi’s disciples can’t be underestimated.

137
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,030
Especially Qian Feng,

138
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:25,790
he's the most gifted cultivator I’ve ever seen.

139
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,470
Zi Xin

140
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:28,950
was once his cauldron,

141
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:34,030
she may become a crack in his Dao Heart someday.

142
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:38,510
As for Liu Mei’s domain,

143
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,990
Zhou Wutai’s Emotion Severing Domain

144
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,310
might stand a chance against it !

145
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:50,230
Liu Mei seems drawn to Wang Lin’s domain...

146
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:52,550
This kid

147
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:58,350
might be the key to breaking Zhuque Zi’s game !

148
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:01,870
Senior Brother,

149
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:04,470
our wager back then

150
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:06,870
stipulated 1 000 years of seclusion.

151
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:09,510
In 12 years,

152
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:12,110
this old man will be free.

153
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:16,510
Then we’ll see who will inherit the title of Suzaku.

154
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:19,190
Who knows what will happen...

155
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:25,070
Ceng Niu’s attack on Xue Yue

156
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,350
ended with him singlehandedly

157
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:29,510
slaying its Suzerain,

158
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,840
sealing all the cultivators

159
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:36,590
and demoting the country to rank 3 !

160
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:39,590
The mighty Li Yuanfeng

161
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,070
has been

162
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:43,350
defeated !

163
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:53,030
Li Yuanfeng was just a trash forcibly raised to Soul Transformation.

164
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:54,750
Ceng Niu,

165
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:57,720
if you can kill the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor

166
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:59,520
then you’ll barely qualify

167
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,390
as my opponent.

168
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:22,470
Senior,

169
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:25,030
I used Soul Search on Li Yuanfeng

170
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:27,310
but found no clues about you.

171
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,520
You said that

172
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,510
I'll be able to wake you at Soul Transformation.

173
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,960
That must be because I need celestial spiritual energy.

174
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:45,760
Li Yuanfeng's cultivation was forcibly raised

175
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:48,120
and he lacked celestial spiritual energy.

176
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,480
But the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor

177
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:51,230
has a genuine cultivation.

178
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:53,470
With his teleportation spell,

179
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:55,950
even Sun Tai feared him.

180
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,350
I'm not sure

181
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,670
if I can fight him.

182
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:06,630
That day, the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor insisted on taking my body...

183
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:10,350
I have my own reasons.

184
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:12,360
He must have learned

185
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:15,280
about the Heaven Defying Bead from his clansmen.

186
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,880
Once he recovers from his injuries,

187
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:19,880
he’ll surely come back for me.

188
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,000
Do I fight

189
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,590
or do I flee ?

190
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,000
If I fight,

191
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,310
the outcome is uncertain.

192
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:30,480
But if I flee,

193
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:33,390
I will miss my best chance to kill him !

194
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:36,880
Who is it ?

195
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,510
I am Ouyang Tian,

196
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,990
I was sent by Ancestor Du Tian

197
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:43,320
to deliver something to you.

198
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,720
Ancestor Du Tian knows your plans

199
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:49,680
so he instructed me

200
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:50,800
to give you this.

201
00:15:53,520 --> 00:15:54,910
Little friend Ceng Niu,

202
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:57,430
I cannot leave seclusion

203
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,150
but I can offer you this instead.

204
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:04,080
This jade slip

205
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:08,430
details how to counter the Giant Demon Clan's teleportation spell.

206
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:14,150
So that's how...

207
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,710
And this other item

208
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,390
is something you’ve seen before.

209
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:26,070
The Billion-Soul Flag ?!

210
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,240
This is just an illusory sub flag

211
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:47,040
that can only be used twice.

212
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:50,470
This sub flag has a third of the true flag's power.

213
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:54,030
The 12 golden soul fragments

214
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:58,950
are past Sect Leaders who reached Soul Transformation.

215
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,280
With them,

216
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:03,990
this flag’s power

217
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,750
is no joke.

218
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:13,470
To control this Soul Flag

219
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,590
you must cast

220
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,550
the Soul Sealing spell.

221
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,190
What a powerful pressure !

222
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:57,600
Seal !

223
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,390
Alright,

224
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,190
I’ve given you everything.

225
00:18:58,600 --> 00:18:59,350
Little friend,

226
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:02,550
I will wait for you at the Soul Refining Sect.

227
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:07,110
I will never forget your kindness.

228
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:16,200
Giant Demon Clan Ancestor,

229
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:17,990
you won't escape this !

230
00:19:39,670 --> 00:19:42,970
To let go of the consequences of my actions

231
00:19:42,970 --> 00:19:44,690
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

232
00:19:44,730 --> 00:19:46,630
like scattered ink.

233
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:54,110
As destiny falls

234
00:19:50,350 --> 00:19:54,110
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

235
00:19:54,110 --> 00:20:01,710
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

236
00:19:57,350 --> 00:20:01,710
wither and melt into rivers.

237
00:20:02,150 --> 00:20:09,270
Who can deceive

238
00:20:04,910 --> 00:20:09,270
the law of the heavens ?

239
00:20:09,590 --> 00:20:12,590
Countless generations

240
00:20:10,870 --> 00:20:12,590
have tried before me.

241
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:16,310
But how could I not catch my dreams

242
00:20:14,710 --> 00:20:16,310
within my warm fingers ?

243
00:20:16,870 --> 00:20:20,390
You're at my side when I'm alone

244
00:20:20,390 --> 00:20:23,710
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

245
00:20:24,470 --> 00:20:27,670
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

246
00:20:28,030 --> 00:20:31,870
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

247
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:31,870
in the streets.

248
00:20:32,030 --> 00:20:36,830
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

249
00:20:33,590 --> 00:20:36,830
Can I break the rules ?

250
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:39,550
To run towards you !

251
00:20:39,590 --> 00:20:42,870
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

252
00:20:42,870 --> 00:20:47,510
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

253
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:50,910
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

254
00:20:50,950 --> 00:20:55,590
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

255
00:20:56,040 --> 00:21:01,270
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

256
00:21:01,390 --> 00:21:05,190
If your soul is willing to wander,

257
00:21:05,190 --> 00:21:09,830
can I still take your hands

258
00:21:06,870 --> 00:21:09,830
and hold them tight ?

259
00:21:09,990 --> 00:21:12,910
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

260
00:21:12,910 --> 00:21:17,790
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

261
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:21,070
I dream of destroying

262
00:21:21,230 --> 00:21:25,790
the shackles of our fate.

263
00:21:25,790 --> 00:21:29,750
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

264
00:21:29,750 --> 00:21:32,550
You're the hardest to let go of.

265
00:21:32,630 --> 00:21:36,430
I want to be with you again

266
00:21:36,510 --> 00:21:39,790
so I can look in your eyes.

267
00:21:40,070 --> 00:21:45,030
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
